      "content": "maybe i shouldn't just write about it. maybe the only way to actually capture that kind of void is to... i don't know. it feels like there's this line between just describing pain and actually embodying it. like, for art to be truly raw, shouldn't there be some kind of actual sacrifice involved? like you have to lose something real to make something real?",
